+All 53 tests must pass; none are registered `DISABLED`. Run the suite **as root** too when touching the compressor: some paths only exist with root (see "Idle-page read tracking"), and an unprivileged run — which is all CI does — never executes them. CI (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`) runs the full suite on `ubuntu-latest` and `macos-latest` on every push and PR. Twenty-eight of the tests are end-to-end under `DYLD_INSERT_LIBRARIES` / `LD_PRELOAD`:
 
